{9}{Oh - well, my mistake, sir. I had assumed - make that hoped - that you were the first of some sell-swords Tasamas and Natemun had gone to the city to hire. I meant no offense, but we don't get many sight-seers this time of year, and I jumped to the wrong conclusion.}{Oh, - my mistake, madam. I had assumed - make that hoped - that you were the first of some sell-swords Tasamas and Natemun had gone to the city to hire. I meant no offense, but we don't get many sight-seers this time of year, and I jumped to the wrong conclusion.}{}{}{}{}
{10}{No offense is taken. However, I could use a little information  about what's happening here.}{}{5}{}{15}{}
