{25}{About a month ago, me an' three others were going into the tanglewood grove - just up the road there - to trim back an area that had grown over. We were about half-way in, when all of a sudden, these giant, green spider-woman things came running towards us. [He pauses] It was really strange because they kept changing from the spider-thing to a human woman. }{About a month ago, me an' three others were going into the tanglewood grove - just up the road there - to trim back an area that had grown over. We were about half-way in, when all of a sudden, these giant, green spider-woman things came running towards us. [He pauses] It was really strange because they kept changing from the spider-thing to a human woman. }{}{}{}{}
{26}{[You listen]}{}{1}{}{33}{}

{33}{And then, Lankara, who was the furthest ahead, suddenly started running towards them like they were old friends or something. One of those things pounced on him and sunk its fangs into him. The others paused for just an instant, then came at us again. Well we took off running and we actually made it out of the grove before Tom and Dooley got caught in the things' magic spell.}{And then, Lankara, who was the furthest ahead, suddenly started running towards them like they were old friends or something. One of those things pounced on him and sunk its fangs into him. The others paused for just an instant, then came at us again. Well we took off running and we actually made it out of the grove before Tom and Dooley got caught in the things' magic spell.}{}{}{}{}
{34}{[You listen]}{}{1}{}{40}{}
{35}{I see. Well, this has been an interesting conversation, but I don't see where it concerns me, so good day.}{}{5}{}{55}{}
{36}{Well, dis been intrustin' but not matter to me. Me say bye now.}{}{-4}{}{55}{}

{40}{When Tom and Dooley suddenly stopped running, for just a moment, I wanted to go back too. But then it passed and I was across the Little Creek Bridge and heading for the manor house to raise the alarm. Everyone came running and we grabbed torches and what bows we have and that's how we managed to keep the beasties contained on the island.}{When Tom and Dooley suddenly stopped running, for just a moment, I wanted to go back too. But then it passed and I was across the Little Creek Bridge and heading for the manor house to raise the alarm. Everyone came running and we grabbed torches and what bows we have and that's how we managed to keep the beasties contained on the island.}{}{}{}{gf 2780 1, qu 1167 1, ru 2232}
