{45}{Yep. A split in the river forms it. Anyway - That's when Mr. Yoki gave the order to cut down the trees and keep bonfires going so we could starve 'em out. I'm not too sure it's working so good though. Everytime a bird flies over the grove, it lands. Those beasties may be gettin' hungry but I don't think they're starving. }{Yep. A split in the river forms it. Anyway - That's when Mr. Yoki gave the order to cut down the trees and keep bonfires going so we could starve 'em out. I'm not too sure it's working so good though. Everytime a bird flies over the grove, it lands. Those beasties may be gettin' hungry but I don't think they're starving. }{}{}{}{}
{46}{Is the river high enough to keep them contained?}{}{5}{}{49}{}
{47}{Is river high enuff to help keep dese spiders in da grove?}{}{-4}{}{49}{}
{48}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{49}{Lucky for us, it had been really wet season and the streams are running high and fast, otherwise those things would be able to just wade across and we'd be done for. But I'll tell you though, the high water isn't going to last much longer. Little Creek normally dries up about this time of year.}{Lucky for us, it had been really wet season and the streams are running high and fast, otherwise those things would be able to just wade across and we'd be done for. But I'll tell you though, the high water isn't going to last much longer. Little Creek normally dries up about this time of year.}{}{}{}{}
{50}{Lucky indeed! So it's been a stand-off. Why don't you just burn the grove down and be done with it?}{}{5}{}{57}{}
