{52}{I see. Well, this has been an interesting conversation, but I don't see where it concerns me, so I shall bid you good day.}{}{5}{}{55}{}
{53}{Well, dis been intrustin' but not matter to me. Me say bye now and hope your help come soon.}{}{-4}{}{55}{}
